# <type>(<scope>): <subject>
#
# Subject: imperative, lowercase, no trailing period, <= 72 chars.
#
# Body: what changed and why. Wrap at 72. Skip the body for trivial
# commits where the subject is self-explanatory.
#
# Footer (optional): one trailer per line.
#   BREAKING CHANGE: <description>
#   Refs: #<issue>
#   AI-assisted: yes | partial | no
#
# Types
#   feat      new user-visible behavior
#   fix       bug fix
#   docs      documentation only
#   refactor  no behavior change
#   perf      performance, no behavior change
#   test      add or fix tests
#   chore     toolchain, build, deps, config
#   ci        CI configuration
#   style     formatting only
#   build     build system or external deps
#
# Scopes (free-form). Common: a11y, data, ui, ci, deps, docs, theme.
